    </prov:Association>
  </prov:qualifiedAssociation>
  <vaem:rationale>CQ33 was uncovered due to a missing dc:source citation. Since CQ33 asks about inheritance without supplying new terms, the citation was added to the Rule class, which represents the hierarchical structure enabling inheritance in the model.</vaem:rationale>
